<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n85478" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολυ-φάρμᾰκος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>knowing many drugs</i> or
				<i>charms,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰητροί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					16.28
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Κίρκη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					10.276
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Παιών</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Sol.
					13.57
				</span></i>
			; of Medea, <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				3.27
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>given to the use of drugs,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				10.169
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> of countries,
				<i>abounding in healing</i> or <i>poisonous herbs,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Τυρρηνία</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Thphr.
					<u>HP</u>
					9.15.1
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<i>compounded of many drugs,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δυνάμεις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.408b
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				13.365
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
    <div class="alpheios-lex-alph-source">From <u>
            <u>A Greek-English Lexicon</u>
        </u> (Henry George Liddell, Robert Scott, Oxford, Clarendon Press, 1940) </div>
